   "display_name": null,
   "comment": "Static APK/DEX inspection, 2026-10-24; parent SHA-256 verified. com.google.android.system.service.TcpLogger.send$lambda$0 contains host literal 45.67.138.24. Its status branch passes port 1113 to Socket(String,int) at DEX code-unit PC 49; its log branch passes port 1112 at PC 145. Both paths obtain output streams and write/flush UTF-8 messages. These are logging/status backends, not automatically the native bot's C2. MuhHeilong.extractAndExecute contains native deployment logic and libkys.so paths including /tmp, /data/local/tmp, /data and /dev/shm. The packaged lib/arm64-v8a/libkys.so was statically extracted: SHA-256 aeaafb0a5653d4ae748e70b19d83c05a5c762dc6a5181c4c03410e8e881fae01, 783272 bytes. It contains compiled wget/TFTP templates for 217.60.195.187, along with /tmp/.qv3b persistence-related strings. Templates alone do not prove current URL availability or a successful download. Also includes res/raw/adb_key; no key material reproduced. Historical capture; no fresh infrastructure claim, malware execution or endpoint contact."
